          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148030,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zaznacz kod należący do tych funkcji.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"113\" endIndex=\"114\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"healPlayer\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player healed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"spawnEnemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy spawned&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"healPlayer();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>{</code>, następnie <code>}</code>, a potem <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148031,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dlaczego tworzymy funkcje?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Aby grupować i ponownie wykorzystywać powiązany kod</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Aby oddzielić powiązany kod</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Aby ułatwić tworzenie zmiennych</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Aby grupować i ponownie wykorzystywać powiązany kod.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148032,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co się dzieje, gdy wywołujemy funkcję?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Kod wewnątrz funkcji wykonuje się</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Cały kod wewnątrz funkcji jest przechowywany w zmiennej</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Pętla while jest tworzona wewnątrz funkcji</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Kod wewnątrz funkcji wykonuje się.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148033,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dokończ wywoływanie funkcji, wpisując jej nazwę.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"115\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayScore\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" label = \" /><text value=\"&quot; points&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(score + label);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayScore();}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>displayScore</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148034,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"startLevel\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"startLevel();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level started&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>1</code> w jednym wierszu, a <code>Level started</code> w następnym</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Level started</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>1</code> w jednym wierszu, a <code>Level started</code> w następnym.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148035,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jaki jest parametr w tej funkcji?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"addItemToInventory\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"item\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" text = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Picked up: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(text + item);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>item</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>text</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nie ma parametru</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>item</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148036,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wywołaj funkcję i przekaż jej wartość.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"var\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"116\" /><option startIndex=\"117\" endIndex=\"118\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"removeItemFromInventory\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"item\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Dropped: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + item);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"removeItemFromInventory(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Health Potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>removeItemFromInventory</code>, następnie <code>\"Health Potion\"</code> i na końcu <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
